  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "Corsair merchants who treat law as another commodity to buy, dodge, or sink.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Myrrakai build harbors like marketplaces and marketplaces like traps. Their captains court fortune, fame, and scandal with equal appetite, and their councils are forever rewriting maritime custom to favor whichever fleet has returned richest. Even so, they honor salvage shares, sea oaths, and the freedom of any ship that can outrun the harbor guns."
